>> hex := Kapangidwe chatsopano: ['%x'].

# write 10
Zotuluka lembani: Hx xA, mzere-watsopano.

# make it easy to write numbers as hex
Nambala chikafika: ['as-hex'] chitani: { <- hex gwiritsa-pa-nambala-yonse: wekha.
}.

# write
Zotuluka lembani: Hx xA as-hex, mzere-watsopano.
Zotuluka lembani: Hx xFF as-hex, mzere-watsopano.